%N A016128 Inverse of 2119th cyclotomic polynomial.
%C A016128 Periodic with period length 2119. - _Ray Chandler_, Apr 07 2017
%H A016128 Ray Chandler, <a href="/A016128/b016128.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..3000</a>
%H A016128 <a href="/index/Per#periodic">Index entries for periodic sequences</a>, period 2119.
%H A016128 <a href="/index/Rec#order_1944">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, order 1944.
%H A016128 <a href="/index/Pol#poly_cyclo_inv">Index to sequences related to inverse of cyclotomic polynomials</a>
%p A016128 with(numtheory,cyclotomic); c := n->series(1/cyclotomic(n,x),x,80);
%t A016128 Module[{x, nmax = 100}, PadRight[CoefficientList[Series[1/Cyclotomic[2119, x], {x, 0, nmax}], x], nmax + 1]] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Oct 14 2026 *)
%o A016128 (PARI) first(n)=Vec(1/polcyclo(2119)+O(x^(n+1))) \\ _Charles R Greathouse IV_, Jun 01 2026
%K A016128 sign,easy,changed
%O A016128 0,1
%A A016128 _Simon Plouffe_
